OL,3,GNEWSAAnnual fun fair cancelled due to
OL,4,Atown centre work
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn annual fair has been cancelled
OL,7,Fbecause of ongoing work in a town
OL,8,Fcentre.
OL,10,FLong Eaton is undergoing a #10 million
OL,11,Fregeneration program, which began in
OL,12,FJune and is scheduled to be completed
OL,13,Fin spring 2027.
OL,15,FAs a result, the three-day Chestnut
OL,16,FFair, held in the town centre since the
OL,17,F1990s, will not be able to take place
OL,18,Fthis November, said Erewash Borough
OL,19,FCouncil and street fair organisers
OL,20,FMellors Group.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
