OL,3,GNEWSAAnnual fun fair cancelled due to
OL,4,Atown centre work
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a joint statement, they said: "We
OL,7,Fknow that this will be a disappointment
OL,8,Ffor many people who enjoy the popular
OL,9,Fstreet fair every November, but rest
OL,10,Fassured that the Chestnut Fair will be
OL,11,Fback in Long Eaton next year."
